@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About Us";
}
<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card shadow">
                <div class="card-header bg-secondary text-white">
                    <h1 class="mb-0">About This Project</h1>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p class="lead">Welcome to the Story Generator!</p>
                    <p>
                        This project is an interactive web application designed to help parents, teachers, and children create personalized stories and matching images with the help of AI. Simply select or enter the age range, theme, plot, and any extra details, and our AI will generate a unique story and a beautiful title image for you.
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Customizable:</strong> Choose from preset or custom options for age, theme, and plot.</li>
                        <li><strong>AI-Powered:</strong> Stories and images are generated using advanced AI models.</li>
                        <li><strong>Fun & Educational:</strong> Great for bedtime stories, classroom activities, or creative inspiration.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>
                        This project was created to make storytelling more accessible, creative, and fun for everyone. We hope you enjoy using it as much as we enjoyed building it!
                    </p>
                    <hr />
                    <p class="text-muted small">&copy; 2024 Story Generator Project. All rights reserved.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div> 